flowchart LR
  ProfileInput[Profile interests, skills, location, availability] --> Filter[Basic published opportunity filtering]
  Filter --> Score[Deterministic scoring]
  Score --> OptionalAI[Optional secure AI request]
  OptionalAI --> Validate[Validate structured response]
  Validate --> Results[Recommendations with explanations]
  OptionalAI -->|missing key or invalid response| Fallback[Rule-based fallback]
  Fallback --> Results
